  "description": "When a junior boldly confesses his feelings and asks permission to stalk him, Jeong-Hyeon is intrigued by the audacity. Amused, he agrees on one condition, turning desire into a secret, physical arrangement meant to be nothing more than fun. But as the relationship continues, Jeong-Hyeon begins to develop real feelings, just as Ji-Wu starts pulling away, leaving them both caught between obsession, vulnerability, and emotions neither intended to face.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes seven extra chapters.*",
